{"name": "Dinolords", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dinolords combines <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, <strong>city-building</strong> and <strong>action RPG</strong> combat in the genre hybrid: <i><strong>Hack\u2019n\u2019Strat</strong></i>. Build your settlement, train armies of soldiers and dinosaurs and take command on the ground as the lord defending England against the invading Danes. A new age of warfare is upon us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/55f0b74ae2414a82ba9ac2c988bc38de.poster.avif?t=1793013138\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/55f0b74ae2414a82ba9ac2c988bc38de.webm?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/55f0b74ae2414a82ba9ac2c988bc38de.mp4?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WASD in RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Dinolords you <i><strong>are</strong></i> the lord. Move with WASD, gather resources, help build your settlement and fight alongside your troops. Use your abilities and cut down enemies to turn the tide yourself. Dinolords brings direct character control into classic RTS gameplay to create a new hybrid Hack\u2019n\u2019Strat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/472668d0355403f80c50a0eee261e948.poster.avif?t=1793013138\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/472668d0355403f80c50a0eee261e948.webm?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/472668d0355403f80c50a0eee261e948.mp4?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your Stronghold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources, construct buildings and grow a thriving medieval settlement. Upgrade your structures and use dinosaurs to power production. Build fortifications that make your stronghold stand firm in the new age of medieval warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/0c8ce3702ab7da67c2049ffbcee998b9.poster.avif?t=1793013138\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/0c8ce3702ab7da67c2049ffbcee998b9.webm?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/0c8ce3702ab7da67c2049ffbcee998b9.mp4?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Danes &amp; Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vikings brought dinosaurs across the sea, each one a distinct force of nature. But their power does not belong to them alone. Tame your own beasts, learn their abilities and evolve the battlefield or face extinction.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/50d8831581cb46836f87657c0ba01896.poster.avif?t=1793013138\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/50d8831581cb46836f87657c0ba01896.webm?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/50d8831581cb46836f87657c0ba01896.mp4?t=1793013138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/extras/a4375289846b298ad526e54227de2732.avif?t=1793013138\" width=\"420\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hybrid of <strong>real-time strategy</strong> and <strong>action RPG</strong> combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource gathering and <strong>dinosaur-powered city building</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human and dinosaur units with unique roles and battlefield behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A campaign that lets you reclaim England region by region</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgradable forces, strongholds, dinosaurs and lord abilities through the Amber Charter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alt-history England reshaped by the return of dinosaurs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dinolords combines real-time strategy, city-building and action RPG combat in the genre hybrid Hack\u2019n\u2019Strat. Build your stronghold, command human and dinosaur armies and fight as the lord shaping a new age of warfare.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587620/header.jpg?t=1793013138", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "RTS", "Hack and Slash", "Dinosaurs", "Base Building", "Medieval"], "developers": "Northplay", "publishers": "Northplay", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2587620", "revi